  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Upon disconnecting with a \"VRChat is not responding\" message, there's a slight chance (higher with low bandwidth, even higher if the computer loses connection to the wi-fi and reconnects afterwards) the screen will stay black while an error message appears (but it's invisible behind the black fade-out).\n\nIf the error message is somehow clicked and the game reconnects, downloading new worlds will cause the game to keep downloading the world over and over until you quit and restart the game.\n\nOn rare occasions, a world that you previously were on as you were disconnected will re-download even though it was previously downloaded, and will continue to loop the download until a restart.",
